<https://hexplain.io/ns/image#CodeShapes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for img:colorType, img:compressionMethod, img:filterMethod, img:interlaceMethod. Its constraints below specify the permitted values and combinations."@en .
